  "implementation": "The separate physical A/B/C host joins genuine same-host protected-stream continuity with actual provider-backed PNG/JPEG/WebP bytes. Ancestor A, actual local restore origin B and complete current C stay independent. An existing server-private resolver is reused without changing content-ID or opaque-pair meanings. Original availability/recovery protocols and defaults remain closed.",
  "guarantees": [
